sequenceDiagram
  participant UI
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Worker
  UI->>API: apply(key)
  API->>DB: atomic accept and commit
  API--xUI: network timeout
  UI->>API: retry same key
  API->>DB: replay lookup
  DB-->>UI: same accepted operation, no charge
  Worker->>DB: old fence result
  DB-->>Worker: stale, zero adopted rows
  Note over UI,DB: Published old MP4 remains until accepted success
